node.text:
Nothing exciting. Servicing the jackhammers; working the power lines; losing my hearing. The usual. No time for my projects. But maybe...

			{{emote|*Bright pauses.*}}

			mm. Are you a waterhand? Seeking work?

{{emote|*Bright collects the static in a phial and returns your container. =pronouns.Subjective= =verb:swirl:afterpronoun= it back and forth, entranced.*}}

			Ohhh yes. This is it, there's no mistaking that. You have done well.

			{{emote|*Before you can react, =pronouns.subjective= =verb:quaff:afterpronoun= the entire phial and crumples.*}}

I...

			Pardon me.

			{{emote|*Bright =verb:lurch= to =pronouns.possessive= feet and moves into the light.*}}
